+
+### Visible rotation controls
+
+Move's Show Transform Controls and Free Transform share a visible rotation knob.
+It sits 32 screen points from an edge, follows the transformed box, and moves
+to another edge or inside a tightly fitted box when outside space is unavailable.
+The knob uses the existing rotate gesture and history; an inside knob rotates
+rather than moving pixels. Distort and Warp omit it because their gestures do
+not rotate the box. Resize handles retain their existing hit areas.
